# expect: expected a value after '..' in the match arm
# Both compilers name this rule since _pat_end took the message to use when no
# value follows; tychoc1 used to stop one rule earlier, at `a match arm must be
# a variant name, ...`. src/tychoc.c:3515.
fn main():
    x := 1
    match x:
        1: println("a")
        2.."z": println("c")
        _: println("b")
